@host = http://localhost:5119

### All categories (public)
GET {{host}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### All priorities (public)
GET {{host}}/api/priorities
Accept: application/json

### Register a new account (role User)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uus.kasutaja@example.com",
  "displayName": "Uus Kasutaja",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login as the seeded administrator
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ticketsystem.local",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Current user (needs the token from the login request above)
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a ticket (needs the token from the login request above)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Printer ei tööta",
  "description": "Kolmanda korruse printer ei prindi ja näitab veateadet E-502.",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "priorityId": 2
}

### Get a ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tickets: filter by state, priority and assignee
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?status=New&priority=3&assignee=
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List tickets: search, sort by deadline (soonest first) and page
GET {{host}}/api/tickets?search=printer&sortBy=Deadline&descending=false&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Take a ticket into work (log in as a support person, for example mari.maasikas@ticketsystem.local)
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Change the state of a ticket (assignee or administrator)
PATCH {{host}}/api/tickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Resolved"
}

### Change log of a ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1/log
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add a comment to a ticket
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Tere! Proovisin printerit taaskäivitada, aga viga jäi."
}

### Comments of a ticket
GET {{host}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
